  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/822",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/42c593db187d159efdb83066e0ecf42ceae2a2f9\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/42c593db187d159efdb83066e0ecf42ceae2a2f9\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"527\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/856c30ddd6a5eb17ca81f57e4ff1e146cc51ad80\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/856c30ddd6a5eb17ca81f57e4ff1e146cc51ad80\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"326\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">1986년 </span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">챌린져호의 안타까운 폭발사고.</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">그 챌린져호에 탑승한 승무원 중</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">한명의 교사가 있었어요.</span><br>&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">우주에서 과학실험을 하기 위해</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">미국에서 어마어마한 경쟁율을 뚫고 선발된</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">교사 크리스타 매콜리프(Christa McAuliffe).</span><br>&#160;<br>그녀의 임무는,<br>그녀는 우주에서<br>학생들은 지구의 학교 교실에서 <br>함께 과학실험 수업을 하는 것이였어요.<br>&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">하지만 <br>폭발사고로 </span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">그 과학 수업은 진행되지 못하였죠</span><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9bf7f312863aeb8183fb75d145542d45884a778f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9bf7f312863aeb8183fb75d145542d45884a778f\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"326\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dd6e309c0dadb1af78d08a6f4bcd49e928e16c2e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dd6e309c0dadb1af78d08a6f4bcd49e928e16c2e\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"326\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/45a9cbfe5663be944a1899e9fb3b0c9653ed511b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/45a9cbfe5663be944a1899e9fb3b0c9653ed511b\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"326\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/abf233126b569c824600ff5ea141f8baaf840fbf\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/abf233126b569c824600ff5ea141f8baaf840fbf\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"326\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/aa07ceb19f7a64ed782f471af1406344a3fb4125\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/aa07ceb19f7a64ed782f471af1406344a3fb4125\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"326\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3449f623d298e600d000463229f6be0aafa7c29f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3449f623d298e600d000463229f6be0aafa7c29f\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"326\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">영어 원문:</span></b><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">&quot;...SPACE IS FOR EVERYBODY. IT&#39;S NOT JUST FOR A FEW PEOPLE IN SCIENCE OR MATH, OR FOR A SELECT GROUP OF ASTRONAUTS. THAT&#39;S OUR NEW FRONTIER OUT THERE, AND IT&#39;S EVERYBODY&#39;S BUSINESS TO KNOW ABOUT SPACE.&quot;</span></p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" data-ke-list-type=\"disc\"><li><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Christa McAuliffe</span></p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">한글 번역:</span></b><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">&quot;...우주는 모두를 위한 것입니다. 과학이나 수학을 하는 몇몇 사람들, 혹은 소수의 우주비행사들만을 위한 것이 아닙니다. 저 밖에는 우리의 새로운 개척지가 있으며, 우주에 대해 아는 것은 모두의 일입니다.&quot;</span></p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" data-ke-list-type=\"disc\"><li><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">크리스타 맥콜리프</span></p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br><a href=\"https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%81%AC%EB%A6%AC%EC%8A%A4%ED%83%80_%EB%A7%A4%EC%BD%9C%EB%A6%AC%ED%94%84\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%81%AC%EB%A6%AC%EC%8A%A4%ED%83%80_%EB%A7%A4%EC%BD%9C%EB%A6%AC%ED%94%84</span></a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"크리스타 매콜리프 - 위키백과, 우리 모두의 백과사전\" data-og-description=\"위키백과, 우리 모두의 백과사전. 크리스타 매콜리프Christa McAuliffe출생1948년 9월 2일미국 매사추세츠주 보스턴사망1986년 1월 28일성별여성국적미국학력프래밍험 주립 대학 졸업경력교사직업우주\" data-og-host=\"ko.wikipedia.org\" data-og-source-url=\"https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%81%AC%EB%A6%AC%EC%8A%A4%ED%83%80_%EB%A7%A4%EC%BD%9C%EB%A6%AC%ED%94%84\" data-og-url=\"https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%81%AC%EB%A6%AC%EC%8A%A4%ED%83%80_%EB%A7%A4%EC%BD%9C%EB%A6%AC%ED%94%84\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/eNtnT/hyX4mKpOJK/jugi8DkWk4Zzv2bdoj38u1/img.jpg?width=624&amp;height=901&amp;face=135_271_384_542,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bC2MOG/hyX4sjyHpg/7QAQpOVtxPbtTyUSKw0i51/img.jpg?width=624&amp;height=901&amp;face=135_271_384_542,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/sf7IY/hyX4w7kutg/hQisg6Dr8lAnriNQ1exhS1/img.jpg?width=200&amp;height=289&amp;face=43_87_122_174\"><a href=\"https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%81%AC%EB%A6%AC%EC%8A%A4%ED%83%80_%EB%A7%A4%EC%BD%9C%EB%A6%AC%ED%94%84\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%81%AC%EB%A6%AC%EC%8A%A4%ED%83%80_%EB%A7%A4%EC%BD%9C%EB%A6%AC%ED%94%84\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/eNtnT/hyX4mKpOJK/jugi8DkWk4Zzv2bdoj38u1/img.jpg?width=624&amp;height=901&amp;face=135_271_384_542,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bC2MOG/hyX4sjyHpg/7QAQpOVtxPbtTyUSKw0i51/img.jpg?width=624&amp;height=901&amp;face=135_271_384_542,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/sf7IY/hyX4w7kutg/hQisg6Dr8lAnriNQ1exhS1/img.jpg?width=200&amp;height=289&amp;face=43_87_122_174\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">크리스타 매콜리프 - 위키백과, 우리 모두의 백과사전</p><p class=\"og-desc\">위키백과, 우리 모두의 백과사전. 크리스타 매콜리프Christa McAuliffe출생1948년 9월 2일미국 매사추세츠주 보스턴사망1986년 1월 28일성별여성국적미국학력프래밍험 주립 대학 졸업경력교사직업우주</p><p class=\"og-host\">ko.wikipedia.org</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">그리고</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">몇년 전 </span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">우주정거장에서</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">크리스타가 못한 과학실험 수업이 진행되었다고 합니다</span></b><br><a href=\"https://www.nasa.gov/stem-content/christa-mcauliffes-lost-lessons/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">https://www.nasa.gov/stem-content/christa-mcauliffes-lost-lessons/</span></a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Christa McAuliffe's Lost Lessons - NASA\" data-og-description=\"Teach STEM lessons inspired by the first educator chosen for the Teacher In Space program.\" data-og-host=\"www.nasa.gov\" data-og-source-url=\"https://www.nasa.gov/stem-content/christa-mcauliffes-lost-lessons/\" data-og-url=\"https://www.nasa.gov/stem-content/christa-mcauliffes-lost-lessons/\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/lCRG1/hyX4wGgeUF/puU8c9bHdhybyqEPLZd4i0/img.jpg?width=320&amp;height=299&amp;face=0_0_320_299,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/ekwCOK/hyX4nvMP2k/vmD2GNsn8RFVOj7E3npZx0/img.jpg?width=320&amp;height=299&amp;face=0_0_320_299,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bEXxoB/hyX4onWx5W/OZYkgF4BkBA0L5Q6G74FB1/img.jpg?width=320&amp;height=299&amp;face=0_0_320_299\"><a href=\"https://www.nasa.gov/stem-content/christa-mcauliffes-lost-lessons/\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://www.nasa.gov/stem-content/christa-mcauliffes-lost-lessons/\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/lCRG1/hyX4wGgeUF/puU8c9bHdhybyqEPLZd4i0/img.jpg?width=320&amp;height=299&amp;face=0_0_320_299,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/ekwCOK/hyX4nvMP2k/vmD2GNsn8RFVOj7E3npZx0/img.jpg?width=320&amp;height=299&amp;face=0_0_320_299,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bEXxoB/hyX4onWx5W/OZYkgF4BkBA0L5Q6G74FB1/img.jpg?width=320&amp;height=299&amp;face=0_0_320_299\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Christa McAuliffe's Lost Lessons - NASA</p><p class=\"og-desc\">Teach STEM lessons inspired by the first educator chosen for the Teacher In Space program.</p><p class=\"og-host\">www.nasa.gov</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/759e7d99de4bf6f0d14be7089791b7f2eae84263\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/759e7d99de4bf6f0d14be7089791b7f2eae84263\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"326\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a3adfccab9320cf896d135e3b572a7325ad37784\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a3adfccab9320cf896d135e3b572a7325ad37784\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"326\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8d2c8c442c6fe4e7441a35845138167f9ac69dbd\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8d2c8c442c6fe4e7441a35845138167f9ac69dbd\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"326\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/95c302e55cfdb2cc946ad8938bfb1da0eeb04859\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/95c302e55cfdb2cc946ad8938bfb1da0eeb04859\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"326\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7cdfbc3e94625aab1a1ae4906bc032cb43564201\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7cdfbc3e94625aab1a1ae4906bc032cb43564201\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"326\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/95f776b67eac515bf193620a9f4804d2dcd034c8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/95f776b67eac515bf193620a9f4804d2dcd034c8\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"326\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d286a9d6fa669c36fafcfb74e74eb3248a21efc0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d286a9d6fa669c36fafcfb74e74eb3248a21efc0\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"326\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#39;~실험을 교실에서 해보세요~&#39; 와 같이<br>크리스타가 하고자 했던 과학실험 수업을 <br>영상으로 찍어 <br>우리 지구로 보내왔어요.<br><br>그 지구에 우리 대한민국도 있어요.<br>우리도 함께 하면 되어요.<br>1986년과 2025년.<br><br>&#160;<br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLTUZypZ67cdsV_sJIxD3Fo-b-bePQRkHo\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLTUZypZ67cdsV_sJIxD3Fo-b-bePQRkHo</span></a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Christa's Lost Lessons\" data-og-description=\"NASA and the Challenger Center present Christa's Lost Lessons. Christa McAuliffe was chosen to be the first teacher in space. Due to the tragic space shuttle...\" data-og-host=\"www.youtube.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLTUZypZ67cdsV_sJIxD3Fo-b-bePQRkHo\" data-og-url=\"http://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLTUZypZ67cdsV_sJIxD3Fo-b-bePQRkHo\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/AKs4D/hyX4m4HWqq/YCNML5lFqQktxC4KGYT9lk/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=270&amp;face=0_0_480_270,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bAMheM/hyX4oOZApm/DhS66QDm2qLN4dMX2g8A81/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=270&amp;face=0_0_480_270\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLTUZypZ67cdsV_sJIxD3Fo-b-bePQRkHo\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLTUZypZ67cdsV_sJIxD3Fo-b-bePQRkHo\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/AKs4D/hyX4m4HWqq/YCNML5lFqQktxC4KGYT9lk/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=270&amp;face=0_0_480_270,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bAMheM/hyX4oOZApm/DhS66QDm2qLN4dMX2g8A81/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=270&amp;face=0_0_480_270\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Christa's Lost Lessons</p><p class=\"og-desc\">NASA and the Challenger Center present Christa's Lost Lessons. Christa McAuliffe was chosen to be the first teacher in space. Due to the tragic space shuttle...</p><p class=\"og-host\">www.youtube.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">위 유튜브로</span><br>&quot;<span style=\"color: #000000;\">크리스타의 잃어버린 수업&quot; </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">영상을 보실 수 있어요.</span><br><br><br><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">마지막으로 질문</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">1.우주에서 과학실험을 하는 이유는 무엇일까요?</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">2.과학교사로서 이 내용(영상)을 보고, 무엇을 느끼셨나요?</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">3.개인적으로 우주에서 실험을 해보고 싶은 실험이 있다면 무엇인가요?</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
